# SE Sandbox Whitelist
Only use allowed VRage and Keen namespaces. 
- **ALLOWED**: `Sandbox.ModAPI`, `Interfaces.Gameplay`, `VRage.Game.ModAPI`, `VRageMath`.
- **FORBIDDEN**: `System.IO`, `System.Reflection`, `System.Threading` (except where specifically allowed by ModAPI).
- **Reference**: Use @ModAPI (Documentation) to verify if a method is accessible in the Sandbox.